00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:44,065
stopped it explicitly.

44
00:01:44,787 --> 00:01:46,951
We can add so-called volumes, which is a

45
00:01:46,951 --> 00:01:49,307
more advanced concept, but the idea here

46
00:01:49,451 --> 00:01:50,381
simply is that

47
00:01:50,958 --> 00:01:53,701
data written in the container actually

48
00:01:53,749 --> 00:01:55,980
survives container restarts by being

